<h3 id="unsafe-swift-example-1-compression">Unsafe Swift Example 1: Compression</h3>
<p>It’s time to put what you’ve learned to use and wrap a C API. Cocoa includes a C module that implements common data compression algorithms. These include:</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>LZ4</strong>: for when speed is critical.</li>
  <li><strong>LZ4A</strong>: for when maximum compression ratio matters and speed doesn’t.</li>
  <li><strong>ZLIB</strong>: balances space and speed.</li>
  <li><strong>LZFSE</strong>: the new open-source algorithm, with a better balance of space and speed.</li>
</ul>

