<p>First, you get the random numbers. Then, using the bytes of the returned array, you rebind the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Int8</code> values to the requested type and return a copy.</p>

<p>And that’s it! You now generate random numbers in a safe way, all powered by Swift’s unsafe features.</p>

